# Niriksha Mobile Environment Configuration Template
# Copy this file to `mobile/.env` or `mobile/.env.local` to override local development settings.
# Both `.env` and `.env.local` are ignored by Git.

# Explicit Backend API URL Override:
# - Leave blank or unset to let Niriksha auto-resolve:
#     * Android Emulator -> http://10.0.2.2:8000
#     * Expo Go / Physical Device -> http://<Metro-Host-IP>:8000
#     * iOS Simulator / Web -> http://127.0.0.1:8000
#     * Production APK / Release -> https://niriksha-1.onrender.com
#
# - Or set explicitly to your local or staging backend:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://niriksha-1.onrender.com
